UniswapSwapModule_EncodeDecodeExecutionData
├── given valid execution data
│   └── it should round-trip all fields correctly
├── given empty router calldata
│   └── it should round-trip correctly
├── given large router calldata
│   └── it should round-trip correctly
├── given zero values
│   └── it should round-trip correctly
├── given max values
│   └── it should round-trip correctly
└── fuzz
    └── it should round-trip any valid execution data correctly
